      "viShaya bhOga virakti, vishva lIlA aasakti ।\nkRuShige santata dIkShe, viphalake titikShe ॥\nviShamadali samadRuShTi, vividhAtma sandRuShTi ।\nkushala sAdhanagaLivu - Mankutimma ॥ 778 ॥",
